e":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2316965658,"text":"旅人さん、何かお手伝いが必要なことはありますか？","nextNodeIds":[20110102,20110103]},{"nodeId":20110102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3585860362,"text":"稲妻に行くことについて…","nextNodeIds":[20110104]},{"nodeId":20110104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3762596250,"text":"はい、すでにお聞きしております。南十字船隊の頭領と、稲妻へ向かう約束をしているのですよね？","nextNodeIds":[20110105]},{"nodeId":20110105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3542056194,"text":"確かにもう随分と日が経ちましたが、まだ私のところに情報は何も入ってきていません…","nextNodeIds":[20110106]},{"nodeId":20110106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":756017234,"text":"探したぜ！あんたが姉御の見込んだっていう旅人か？","nextNodeIds":[20110107,20110109]},{"nodeId":20110107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4038069626,"text":"待ってました！","nextNodeIds":[20110108]},{"nodeId":20110108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":1516965098,"text":"そうか、はははっ、そいつは良かった。","nextNodeIds":[20110110]},{"nodeId":20110110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":3620567034,"text":"艦隊の補給作業がほぼ完了した、あとは人員を確認するだけだ。","nextNodeIds":[20110111]},{"nodeId":20110111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":4147150162,"text":"姉御にあんたを探すよう頼まれてな、あんたが船に乗ればすぐに出発できるみたいだぜ。","nextNodeIds":[20110112]},{"nodeId":20110112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3195617578,"text":"やっぱり北斗は約束を守るやつだったな。","nextNodeIds":[20110113]},{"nodeId":20110113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":2310575666,"text":"もちろんさ、姉御の義理堅さはこんなもんじゃないぞ。出航したらあんたらも徐々に分かってくるはずさ。","nextNodeIds":[20110114]},{"nodeId":20110114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3321790314,"text":"もう行かれるのですか？無事に出航できるみたいでよかったです。","nextNodeIds":[20110115]},{"nodeId":20110115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":301341754,"text":"この先が星であろうと深淵であろうと、次の一歩を踏み出すのは良いことだと思います。","nextNodeIds":[20110116]},{"nodeId":20110116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2519812274,"text":"では、またの機会にお会いしましょう。皆さんのご無事を祈っておりますね！","nextNodeIds":[20110117,20110118]},{"nodeId":20110117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3987116346,"text":"キャサリンさん…","nextNodeIds":[20110119]},{"nodeId":20110119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4155787690,"text":"そうだな。ほとんど毎日会ってたから、名残惜しいぞ。","nextNodeIds":[20110120]},{"nodeId":20110120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2078,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2152743226,"text":"うふふ、でしたら、稲妻に着き次第、いち早く私を探し出してくださいね？私は鳴神島であなたたちをお待ちしております。","nextNodeIds":[20110121,20110122]},{"nodeId":20110121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":630160090,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[20110123]},{"nodeId":20110123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1506213594,"text":"やっぱり、稲妻にもキャサリンがいるのかよ！じゃあ、なんでこんな悲しげな雰囲気をかもしだしてたんだ！","nextNodeIds":[20110124]},{"nodeId":20110124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":3584011986,"text":"はははっ、璃月にもきちんとお別れをしてきな。船はもう孤雲閣に止まってる。ちゃんと伝えたから、俺は先に戻るぞ。","nextNodeIds":[20110125]},{"nodeId":20110125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2550642658,"text":"おう、知らせに来てくれてありがとな！","nextNodeIds":[20110126]},{"nodeId":20110126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2440,"speakerName":"海龍","textMapHash":2934009498,"text":"いいってことよ、じゃあ船でな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":20110122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1025697050,"text":"…そんな気はしてた！","nextNodeIds":[20110123]},{"nodeId":20110118,"r