,"speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":2541963594,"text":"もちろんアタシの船隊も大いに本領を発揮したが、それでも少し時間がかかっちまった。","nextNodeIds":[20110706]},{"nodeId":20110706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":119140794,"text":"そうだ、紹介しよう。こいつはトーマ、最近知り合った商売仲間だ。","nextNodeIds":[20110707]},{"nodeId":20110707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":331225570,"text":"よっ、君たちに会えることをずっと楽しみにしてたよ。","nextNodeIds":[20110708]},{"nodeId":20110708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3070421594,"text":"トーマ、この二人は…","nextNodeIds":[20110709]},{"nodeId":20110709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":3465099226,"text":"紹介はいらない。異郷の旅人の名声は、外海の嵐だろうと防げないからね。とっくに耳に入ってるよ。","nextNodeIds":[20110710,20110711]},{"nodeId":20110710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3599913786,"text":"こんにちは、トーマ。","nextNodeIds":[20110712]},{"nodeId":20110712,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1259483010,"text":"嬉しいこと言うなおまえ、えへへっ。","nextNodeIds":[20110713]},{"nodeId":20110713,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":668034754,"text":"ふむ、手間が省けたな。","nextNodeIds":[20110714]},{"nodeId":20110714,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":851745626,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、トーマはもう長いこと離島で活動している、ここの顔役と言っても過言ではないだろう。","nextNodeIds":[20110715]},{"nodeId":20110715,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":840114858,"text":"何か困ったことがあればこいつを訪ねるといい。だが、もしこいつがあんたに不埒を働けば…次、稲妻に来た時、アタシがあんたの代わりにこいつをシメてやる。","nextNodeIds":[20110716]},{"nodeId":20110716,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":3025372642,"text":"アハハッ…安心してくれ、オレたちなら仲良くやれると思うよ。","nextNodeIds":[20110717]},{"nodeId":20110717,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3433515242,"text":"そろそろ時間だ、アタシの船にはまだ「お尋ね者」が一人乗ってるからな。長居はできない。","nextNodeIds":[20110718]},{"nodeId":20110718,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":208428050,"text":"万葉のことか…","nextNodeIds":[20110719]},{"nodeId":20110719,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3228006842,"text":"また会おう！旅人、稲妻でどんな「荒波」に遭おうが、乗り越えてみせろ！","nextNodeIds":[20110720,20110721]},{"nodeId":20110720,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4289772338,"text":"もちろん、自信はある！","nextNodeIds":[20110722]},{"nodeId":20110722,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1859770442,"text":"バイバーイ！元気でな～！北斗船長～！","nextNodeIds":[20110723]},{"nodeId":20110723,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":3262890562,"text":"それじゃ、まずは審査所で登録手続きを済ませよう。","nextNodeIds":[20110724]},{"nodeId":20110724,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4193513346,"text":"えっ、稲妻のお偉いさんに会うのか？こっそりって言ったはずだけど…","nextNodeIds":[20110725]},{"nodeId":20110725,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":3841704234,"text":"ハハッ、「鎖国令」を舐めないでくれ。身分を調べることからは、どう足掻いても逃れられないよ。","nextNodeIds":[20110726]},{"nodeId":20110726,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1033,"speakerName":"トーマ","textMapHash":3220278098,"text":"だからこうして、規則を守りながら規則をかいくぐるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[20110727,20110728]},{"nodeId":20110727,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":305557234,"text":"そ、そっか…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":20110728,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2632372042,"text":"緊張してきた。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":20110721,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1415752002,"text":"次に会うのを楽しみにしてる！","nextNodeIds":[20110722]},{"nodeId":20110711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":118682186,"te